<title>USA: Catskill Financial sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>Catskill Financial sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CATSKILL, N.Y. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catskill Financial said its board declard an initial quarterly dividend of $0.07 per share payable March 17, record February 28.</p>
<p>The company cautioned that although the dividend is characterized as a quarterly dividend, the declaration of dividends is discretionary and there can be no assurance as to when and if future dividends will be declared.</p>
</text>
